te><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135171566,imgsize-144862.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Abandoned New Jersey military site to become $70M community near Netflix studio]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135177692.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/for-20-years-a-former-new-jersey-military-housing-site-sat-abandoned-now-a-70-million-plan-will-replace-the-decaying-complex-with-275-homes-and-new-shops-near-netflixs-planned-1-billion-studio/articleshow/135177692.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/for-20-years-a-former-new-jersey-military-housing-site-sat-abandoned-now-a-70-million-plan-will-replace-the-decaying-complex-with-275-homes-and-new-shops-near-netflixs-planned-1-billion-studio/articleshow/135177692.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T08:46:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135177713,imgsize-844599.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quake Hits Vanuatu: 6.2 tremor strikes at 125 km depth; no damage reports yet]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135182250.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On October 25, the Vanuatu islands experienced a magnitude 6.2 earthquake, originating at a depth of 125 kilometers. This region, known for its seismic volatility and volcanic activity, felt the quake's impact; however, its depth typically minimizes surface shaking. As of now, there are no reports of damage or injuries.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/6-2-magnitude-earthquake-hits-vanuatu-in-pacific-ocean/articleshow/135182250.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/6-2-magnitude-earthquake-hits-vanuatu-in-pacific-ocean/articleshow/135182250.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T08:47:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135182324,imgsize-130660.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[6.3-magnitude earthquake strikes Bonin Islands region of Japan]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135182116.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/6-3-magnitude-earthquake-strikes-bonin-islands-region-of-japan/articleshow/135182116.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/6-3-magnitude-earthquake-strikes-bonin-islands-region-of-japan/articleshow/135182116.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T08:23:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135182136,imgsize-294058.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Will never be safe’: Houthis warn as Riyadh airport resumes flights]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135181692.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[King Khalid International Airport in Riyadh has resumed flight operations following a significant security situation. The airport management has designated specific terminals for domestic and international flights, effective immediately. Meanwhile, the Houthi military spokesperson has reiterated threats against the airport, labeling it a military target. Airlines such as Air India and Air India Express have suspended services to Saudi Arabia as a precaution.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/will-never-be-safe-houthis-warn-as-riyadh-airport-resumes-flights/articleshow/135181692.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/will-never-be-safe-houthis-warn-as-riyadh-airport-resumes-flights/articleshow/135181692.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T07:51:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135181692,imgsize-65628.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Frogan Crowdfunds Legal Fees: Twitch streamer faces $73K bill; fundraiser hits $45,491]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135180000.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Twitch streamer Frogan is seeking donations after Ethan Klein’s company voluntarily dismissed its copyright lawsuit against her on September 8, 2026. Frogan says she still owes $73,000 in legal fees, with total expenses exceeding $100,000. Her GoFundMe campaign has a $200,000 target. Although the dismissal offers relief after more than a year of litigation, it was without prejudice, meaning the company could potentially refile the lawsuit.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-frogan-seeks-73000-in-donations-after-ethan-klein-voluntarily-dismisses-copyright-lawsuit/articleshow/135180000.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-frogan-seeks-73000-in-donations-after-ethan-klein-voluntarily-dismisses-copyright-lawsuit/articleshow/135180000.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T05:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135180006,imgsize-22072.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Streamer Issues Cease-And-Desist: Kai Cenat challenges online allegations; Reggie releases music video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135179990.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kai Cenat has reportedly sent former friend Reggie a cease-and-desist letter over alleged false claims involving serious misconduct. His legal team denied the allegations and demanded that Reggie remove related social media posts. Reggie responded publicly, questioned the letter’s focus and released a music video titled ‘Watch Me!’ that appears to reference the dispute. The controversy has sparked divided reactions online, but no court ruling establishing responsibility has been reported in the provided account.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/exchanged-sx-for-platforming-any-person-kai-cenat-takes-legal-action-against-former-friend-reggie-over-alleged-false-claims-on-social-media/articleshow/135179990.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/exchanged-sx-for-platforming-any-person-kai-cenat-takes-legal-action-against-former-friend-reggie-over-alleged-false-claims-on-social-media/articleshow/135179990.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T04:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135179993,imgsize-95674.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Lie and fabrication': Iran denies Hormuz deal offer to US through Pakistan]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135181328.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/lie-and-fabrication-iran-denies-hormuz-deal-offer-to-us-through-pakistan/articleshow/135181328.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/lie-and-fabrication-iran-denies-hormuz-deal-offer-to-us-through-pakistan/articleshow/135181328.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T06:44:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135181349,imgsize-831926.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['To kill people': Musk accuses Ukraine military of misusing Starlink for drone strikes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135181125.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/to-kill-people-musk-accuses-ukraine-military-of-misusing-starlink-for-drone-strikes/articleshow/135181125.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/to-kill-people-musk-accuses-ukraine-military-of-misusing-starlink-for-drone-strikes/articleshow/135181125.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T06:27:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135181153,imgsize-775921.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Minnesota man jumps onto moving school bus, saves 19 children after driver collapses]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135176580.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-27-year-old-minnesota-man-saw-a-school-bus-carrying-19-children-rolling-with-its-doors-open-jumped-aboard-despite-never-driving-one-and-stopped-it-after-the-driver-suffered-a-medical-emergency/articleshow/135176580.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-27-year-old-minnesota-man-saw-a-school-bus-carrying-19-children-rolling-with-its-doors-open-jumped-aboard-despite-never-driving-one-and-stopped-it-after-the-driver-suffered-a-medical-emergency/articleshow/135176580.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T06:15:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135176670,imgsize-661246.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Canadian University allows convicted murderer on day parole to attend law course, major outrage among students]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135177664.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canadian-university-allows-convicted-murderer-on-day-parole-to-attend-law-course-major-outrage-among-students/articleshow/135177664.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canadian-university-allows-convicted-murderer-on-day-parole-to-attend-law-course-major-outrage-among-students/articleshow/135177664.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T01:41:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135177684,imgsize-157086.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mellon Foundation donates $750,000 grant to University of California to establish South Asian American studies centre]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135177181.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mellon-foundation-donates-750000-grant-to-university-of-california-to-establish-south-asian-american-studies-centre/articleshow/135177181.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mellon-foundation-donates-750000-grant-to-university-of-california-to-establish-south-asian-american-studies-centre/articleshow/135177181.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T00:48:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135177317,imgsize-144310.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['I'm on the brink of breaking down': Indian woman forced to leave Australia before settling late brother’s estate after visa waiver rejection]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135176405.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/im-on-the-brink-of-breaking-down-indian-woman-forced-to-leave-australia-before-settling-late-brothers-estate-after-visa-waiver-rejection/articleshow/135176405.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/im-on-the-brink-of-breaking-down-indian-woman-forced-to-leave-australia-before-settling-late-brothers-estate-after-visa-waiver-rejection/articleshow/135176405.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T00:13:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135176558,imgsize-64624.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Drone strikes kill 3: Kyiv hits Omsk plant and Ozon hub; power cut in Crimea and east]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135175254.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ukraine launched drone strikes against Russian targets in Omsk, hitting a petrochemical plant and a warehouse. In retaliation, a Russian drone attack on Ukraine's Dnipropetrovsk region resulted in three civilian deaths and injuries. The strikes also caused significant disruptions to electricity in Crimea and other occupied areas of Ukraine. Power restoration efforts are ongoing as residents face temporary power cuts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-targets-russian-petrochemical-plant-warehouse-moscow-strikes-kill-3/articleshow/135175254.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-targets-russian-petrochemical-plant-warehouse-moscow-strikes-kill-3/articleshow/135175254.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-24T23:18:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135175633,imgsize-307864.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Solar storm delayed a train by 16 minutes in 1848, not 1841: How scientists solved a 155-year-old mystery]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135142131.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A fascinating correction has emerged from the archives concerning a train delay in Exeter. Initially reported incorrectly, researchers have clarified that the incident actually transpired on October 18, 1848. This revelation was achieved through the analysis of railway records and contemporary newspapers, alongside geomagnetic data, which pointed to a significant solar storm influencing the delay during that time.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/for-155-years-scientists-believed-a-solar-storm-delayed-a-train-in-exeter-england-in-1841-but-the-railway-did-not-exist-until-1846-researchers-now-say-the-storm-and-the-16-minute-delay-really-happened-in-1848/articleshow/135142131.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/for-155-years-scientists-believed-a-solar-storm-delayed-a-train-in-exeter-england-in-1841-but-the-railway-did-not-exist-until-1846-researchers-now-say-the-storm-and-the-16-minute-delay-really-happened-in-1848/articleshow/135142131.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T02:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135143202,imgsize-1336895.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Dallas homeowners lost their $58,150 repair claim after a court ruled they filed too late]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135155850.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A federal appeals court has ruled against Dallas residents who sought over $58,000 from State Farm for water damage from a 2021 freeze, determining that their lawsuit was not filed within the required timeframe of their insurance policy. State Farm had already compensated for initial damages but denied further claims, especially since the homeowners declined additional living costs during property repairs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2021-a-dallas-homes-flooring-was-damaged-after-a-neighbours-frozen-pipes-burst-the-insurer-paid-4261-but-homeowners-later-sought-58150-in-repairs-and-an-october-22-court-rejected-the-delayed-claim/articleshow/135155850.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2021-a-dallas-homes-flooring-was-damaged-after-a-neighbours-frozen-pipes-burst-the-insurer-paid-4261-but-homeowners-later-sought-58150-in-repairs-and-an-october-22-court-rejected-the-delayed-claim/articleshow/135155850.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T02:54:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135155896,imgsize-1178914.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Alleged Mortgage Fraud Exposed: Lawsuits detail DSCR loan flips; Baltimore housing suffers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135139442.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 2022, a property in Baltimore purchased for $43,000 astonishingly changed hands for $310,000 just a year later. This sharp spike in valuation has led to accusations of inflated property prices by investors, resulting in numerous foreclosures. Federal lawsuits allege a scheme involving over 150 properties generating millions in loans, prompting lender scrutiny and investigations into the housing market, revealing Baltimore's deep-seated issues with housing insecurity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-baltimore-house-bought-for-43000-in-2022-was-resold-for-310000-in-2023-three-years-later-it-was-listed-for-35000-after-foreclosure-as-lenders-alleged-a-wider-property-fraud-scheme-involving-hundreds-of-homes/articleshow/135139442.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-baltimore-house-bought-for-43000-in-2022-was-resold-for-310000-in-2023-three-years-later-it-was-listed-for-35000-after-foreclosure-as-lenders-alleged-a-wider-property-fraud-scheme-involving-hundreds-of-homes/articleshow/135139442.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T01:56:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135139488,imgsize-2000755.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[170-year-old portrait sold for $882 in 2025 fetches $230,400 after man's identity is discovered]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135142426.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A photograph that fetched $882 at a New York auction last year has now been identified as a portrait of George Boyer Vashon, the first licensed African American lawyer in New York State. Experts recognized its historical significance, leading Sotheby's to auction it for an astonishing $230,400, far surpassing its initial estimate. This revelation underscores the profound impact of historical context on art valuation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1856-a-photographer-captured-a-man-whose-identity-was-forgotten-after-selling-in-2025-as-an-unknown-sitter-the-portrait-was-traced-to-new-yorks-first-licensed-black-lawyer-and-sold-for-230400/articleshow/135142426.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1856-a-photographer-captured-a-man-whose-identity-was-forgotten-after-selling-in-2025-as-an-unknown-sitter-the-portrait-was-traced-to-new-yorks-first-licensed-black-lawyer-and-sold-for-230400/articleshow/135142426.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-25T00:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135142943,imgsize-64612.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[4 people stabbed at New York home; woman shot by cops after charging at officers with knife]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135175804.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/4-people-stabbed-at-new-york-home-woman-shot-by-cops-after-charging-at-officers-with-knife/articleshow/135175804.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/4-people-stabbed-at-new-york-home-woman-shot-by-cops-after-charging-at-officers-with-knife/a